This directory contains a newly written implementation of the wire codec,
response transformations, and local playback fallback. It is not a copy of
the upstream minified JavaScript bundle or protobuf-ts runtime.

Changes include removing all third-party Worker forwarding, key collection
and persistent classification caches; local fail-open decoding; configurable
Shorts content filtering; preservation of unknown wire fields; and idempotent
caption/settings updates. Upstream cloud playback processing is not included.
